<title>USA: TABLE - Gryphon Holdings Q2 shr $0.32.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Gryphon Holdings Q2 shr $0.32.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			  1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $	 0.32	   $	 0.05</p>
<p> Net			  2,167			337</p>
<p> Revs			30,500		   25,196</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,688		    6,656</p>
<p>	  6 MONTHS</p>
