<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers.)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company said results in second quarter of 1996 were influenced by reserve increases in a truck leasing program and used car dealers program, each discontinued in 1995.</p>
<p>Included in the second quarter of 1997 were $12,000 of capital gains, compared with realized capital losses in 1996 of $190,000, which on an after-tax basis decreased per share earnings by $0.02.</p>
<p>Excluding capital transactions, net income from operations for the second quarter of 1997 was $0.32 per share, compared wth $0.07 in the 1996 quarter.</p>
<p>Full company name is Gryphon Holdings Inc.</p>
